cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  analytic-prophet: Prophet's model without Stan, fitted to the optimum
  that Prophet's own optimizer misses
abstract: >-
  Prophet's model without Stan, fitted to the optimum that Prophet's own
  optimizer misses. Prophet's changepoint prior makes its objective
  non-differentiable exactly where the optimum sits, and the smooth
  optimizers it uses stop short of it. This package fits the same model --
  verified against Stan's own log_prob -- with a gradient written out by
  hand and a small C++ core, and solves an exact reformulation that has no
  such kink. Ships with a four-tier evaluation suite: a correctness gate,
  parameter recovery on synthetic series, held-out forecast accuracy on a
  frozen census of M4 weekly and daily series, and cost.
type: software
